item.description:
&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Mentoring comes to my mind, being mature means for me to be a wise mentor for the younger. I am grateful for the work of Jon Young and Bill Plotkin and their teachers, mentors and elders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;

&lt;!-- wp:paragraph --&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m 47 and deeply grateful for this exercise.  After an initial reading, I think this is a wonderful template for moving forward and plan to return to it many times.  It&#039;s helped me bring into focus my character flaws and my truest goals.  Thank you so much for this gift.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;!-- /wp:paragraph --&gt;
